---
description: Name test files after the module they cover, not the ticket.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Tests match the module, not the ticket

- `tracks.ts` → `tracks.test.ts` in the same folder.
- Do not name files or folders after the ticket, slice, or epic (`discover.test.ts` for SHOW-7 when the module is `suggestions.ts`).
- Do not add a leftover file that only exists because of the ticket name.
